wler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/23/5118639/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←懐かしい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/23/5118639/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これまた嘘です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/23/5118639/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/23/5118639/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんとした斎藤ちはるちゃんです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/23/5118639/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/23/5118639/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやはちはるんの笑顔がだいすきだよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/23/5118639/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近キャラが崩壊してきて、はっちゃけてる斎藤さん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/23/5118639/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも面白いです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/23/5118639/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『まあや♪まあや♪まあや♪』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って嬉しいことにインコちゃんみたいにずっといってくれます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/23/5118639/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-cr